    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>UNIQUE CONTROLS</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574420/extras/drawingtablet.PNG?t=1724965786\" /></span><br>(<i>Although Keyboard + Mouse is still absolutely playable!</i>)</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><strong>Olive</strong> is a struggling artist in her late 20s who sleeps alone at a government funded art studio that's short on supplies. Receiving a giftcard for <strong>UNLIMITED</strong> purchases at &quot;<i>Magi-Art</i>&quot; art store, how could she not chase up this opportunity?<br><br>Tricked into entering the wizard's tower, she now must fight off waves of freakazoid art monsters so she can escape and claim her prize!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><strong>Olive's Art-Venture</strong> is a spell-slinging arena and mobbing game. Use the paper on the right side of the screen to draw shapes and cast spells, damaging enemies and protecting you. Every level introduces a new enemy as you attempt to make your way to the top floor and kick whoever's butt built this crazy place.<br><br>If she's extra efficient and collects enough coins, she'll enter <strong>FRENZY</strong> mode and be able to cast an infinite amount of spells for a short duration.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle through 8 Floors<br></li><li>New enemies on every floor<br></li><li>A special Boss Battle at the end<br></li><li>Takes 20-30 minutes total to playthrough</li></ul>",
